| `I_peak`         | Peak solar irradiance during day (W/m²)                         | --  |   800 |
| `period`         | Period of day/night cycle (seconds, default 24 hours)                         | s  |   86400 |
| `phase_shift`         | Phase shift to set sunrise time (seconds, default 6 AM = 21600 s)                         | s  |   21600 |
| `omega`         | Angular frequency for the cycle                         | --  |   2 * π / period |

## Connectors

 * `y` - This connector represents a real signal as an output from a component ([`RealOutput`](@ref))
